{
  "_comment": [
    "PLACEHOLDER — slice 6.3. This is the template, not a working file.",
    "",
    "Copy it to `google-services.json` (which .gitignore excludes) and replace every PLACEHOLDER",
    "value with the real ones, or download the real file from the Firebase console: Project",
    "settings -> Your apps -> Android -> google-services.json. The Android package name registered",
    "there MUST be com.axa.motorclaims, because FCM binds to the applicationId compiled into the APK.",
    "",
    "This file is named `.placeholder` on purpose. The Gradle plugin hard-fails on a google-services",
    "file whose values are not real, so committing a placeholder under the real name would break",
    "every build on a clean clone. `android/app/build.gradle` applies the plugin only when a",
    "google-services.json exists AND does not carry the PLACEHOLDER marker, so a copy made without",
    "filling it in is skipped rather than fatal — and a build with no Firebase project compiles fine,",
    "it simply cannot receive push.",
    "",
    "It is NOT a credential: this file is compiled into the APK and ships to every handset. The",
    "credential is the service-account JSON on the server (Push:Fcm:ServiceAccountJsonPath), which is",
    "a mounted secret and never lives in this repository.",
    "",
    "At handover this swaps to AXA's own Firebase project, exactly like every Appendix A value. The",
    "current project is developer-owned (decision 2026-08-24); who owns it in production is #49."
  ],
  "project_info": {
    "project_number": "000000000000",
    "project_id": "PLACEHOLDER-firebase-project-id",
    "storage_bucket": "PLACEHOLDER-firebase-project-id.appspot.com"
  },
  "client": [
    {
      "client_info": {
        "mobilesdk_app_id": "1:000000000000:android:PLACEHOLDER0000000000",
        "android_client_info": {
          "package_name": "com.axa.motorclaims"
        }
      },
      "oauth_client": [],
      "api_key": [
        {
          "current_key": "PLACEHOLDER-firebase-android-api-key"
        }
      ],
      "services": {
        "appinvite_service": {
          "other_platform_oauth_client": []
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "configuration_version": "1"
}
